#: ../../source/api_Fetch.md:3
msgid ""
"Undici exposes a fetch() method starts the process of fetching a resource"
" from the network."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/api_Fetch.md:5
msgid ""
"Documentation and examples can be found on "
